WEBVTT

00:08:58.162 --> 00:09:00.829
Even more interesting
is how they appear to combine

00:09:00.871 --> 00:09:03.037
in the successful ecosystems we studied.

00:09:03.871 --> 00:09:07.579
On the one hand,
there is no silver bullet,

00:09:07.621 --> 00:09:10.287
no single tool that can solve for trust.

00:09:10.579 --> 00:09:11.746
On the other hand,

00:09:11.787 --> 00:09:14.037
you don't need the seven tools
to be successful.

00:09:14.496 --> 00:09:16.704
You need 3.6, on average.

00:09:17.287 --> 00:09:18.537
So how do you pick?

00:09:19.204 --> 00:09:21.954
It depends on the kind
of ecosystem you design.

00:09:22.912 --> 00:09:25.662
If interactions
among the participants are key,

00:09:25.704 --> 00:09:28.204
like in most social-media ecosystems,

00:09:28.204 --> 00:09:32.621
you will require a combination of access,
transparency and control